// MTCRE course structure and question banks. Modules follow the official MTCRE outline and the
// course slides: static routing (routing tables, check-gateway, distance, ECMP, recursive routes,
// policy routing), stateless tunnels (VLAN, GRE, IPIP, EoIP, WireGuard, /32 addressing) and OSPF
// (theory and configuration). Lessons teach RouterOS 7 with the RouterOS 6 commands as side notes.

